What do you say we give Miss Lane here an exclusive on the real hero of the day?

00:37:55.210 --> 00:38:08.619
Let's take this interview outside.

00:38:08.619 --> 00:38:20.789
interview outside.

00:38:20.789 --> 00:38:22.789
Congratulations on the promotion, Lewis.

00:38:22.789 --> 00:38:28.090
What's the catch?

00:38:28.090 --> 00:38:29.090
No catch.

00:38:29.090 --> 00:38:30.090
You deserved it.

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:35.010
I guess I went a little too far trying to compete.

00:38:35.010 --> 00:38:38.010
I so badly wanted to be the voice of a hero, too,

00:38:38.010 --> 00:38:41.010
that I nearly lost my head.

00:38:41.010 --> 00:38:43.010
Figuratively and literally.

00:38:43.010 --> 00:38:45.010
Thankfully, I didn't.

00:38:45.010 --> 00:38:49.219
You want to know how to be a great reporter?

00:38:49.219 --> 00:38:59.739
Do it your way.

00:38:59.739 --> 00:39:03.619
What's with the box? Moving on?

00:39:03.619 --> 00:39:04.619
Moving in.

00:39:04.619 --> 00:39:05.619
You may be going upstairs, but...

00:39:05.619 --> 00:39:08.619
going upstairs, but I'll be keeping cozy right down here.

00:39:08.619 --> 00:39:10.619
Just a few desks over.

00:39:10.619 --> 00:39:12.619
Is it the last of it, Lois?

00:39:12.619 --> 00:39:14.969
Clark.

00:39:14.969 --> 00:39:16.969
Meet your new desk buddy.

00:39:16.969 --> 00:39:23.909
Really? I'm so sorry.

00:39:23.909 --> 00:39:25.909
Lewis. Clark's nice and all.

00:39:25.909 --> 00:39:28.909
If you want to invest in a fix-ropper,

00:39:28.909 --> 00:39:34.619
but he's no blur.

00:39:34.619 --> 00:39:36.619
No. No, he's not.

00:39:36.619 --> 00:39:55.650
After seeing all the trouble that Booster went through

00:39:55.650 --> 00:39:58.650
hiding his insecurities,

00:39:58.650 --> 00:39:59.650
I think I can make the glasses work.

00:39:59.650 --> 00:40:06.449
I can make the glasses work.

00:40:06.449 --> 00:40:07.449
What, what small bill?

00:40:07.449 --> 00:40:08.449
You owned it today.

00:40:08.449 --> 00:40:11.449
You went from sleek to geek in under 24 hours.

00:40:11.449 --> 00:40:12.449
What could be wrong with that?

00:40:12.449 --> 00:40:15.949
I saw the way Cat looked at me.

00:40:15.949 --> 00:40:20.219
I also heard what she said.

00:40:20.219 --> 00:40:22.219
Yeah, and it's perfect.

00:40:22.219 --> 00:40:25.949
It's not perfect.

00:40:25.949 --> 00:40:27.949
No, so it doesn't matter what people say about me.

00:40:27.949 --> 00:40:35.699
This is about you.

00:40:35.699 --> 00:40:41.510
You see, I can fly under the radar.

00:40:41.510 --> 00:40:44.510
I can live down expectations of Clark can,

00:40:44.510 --> 00:40:46.510
as long as the blurs out, they're saving people.

00:40:46.510 --> 00:40:49.179
But...

00:40:49.179 --> 00:40:54.440
What are people gonna think about you?

00:40:54.440 --> 00:41:09.219
The strong and extremely sexy Lois Lane wants to marry this new Clark Kent.

00:41:09.219 --> 00:41:14.940
How could they ever understand that you'd be interested in this?

00:41:14.940 --> 00:41:17.940
Whoa, whoa, stop right there.

00:41:17.940 --> 00:41:23.099
Trust me, Smallville.

00:41:23.099 --> 00:41:25.099
We can make this work.

